  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만에서 좋은 정보 많이 얻어~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>저도 자유학기 수업할때마다 호응이 좋았던 수업들 공유하고자합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>많이 미흡하지만~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래도 반응이 좋았어요~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>재과만에서 정보 얻어 활동지는 제가 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>꽃은 진짜저렴하게 묻지마 랜덤&#160;꽃다발해서 만원에 배송비 3,000원 있어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>꽃 한가득히~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1인당 꽃 6송이로 원없이 작품을 만들었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>주소 링크입니다~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"http://naver.me/xGOTtvla\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://naver.me/xGOTtvla</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>참고하셔서&#160;즐거움가득한&#160;수업되시길&#160;바래요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>꽃 3박스 구입했는데~~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>한박스당 아래처럼 꽃이들어있어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a61eb5b51681f0a4bb95d6ff4883822c76847c5b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a61eb5b51681f0a4bb95d6ff4883822c76847c5b\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/adb4834b2277be6d287615622ac9f4a10a99fc1c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/adb4834b2277be6d287615622ac9f4a10a99fc1c\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f731088ed66a6c09517e9d7168af37b48388a64\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f731088ed66a6c09517e9d7168af37b48388a64\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src